# The protopack's hum, samples on (fixtures/proto: the sound fixture's
# lba.cfg and the outside save with the protopack, flag 12, and the
# saber, flag 2, byte 8). The protopack put on from the inventory (item
# 12, Right three times from item 0) and flown, then taken off in flight
# by the inventory, by F1, and by the saber (item 2, Left three times and
# Down twice), each time put on and flown again. Last, the holomap opened
# in flight with Up held across it, and Twinsen flying again after it.

hold 0.15
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 15
shot start
key Shift_L
sleep 2
key Right
sleep 1
key Right
sleep 1
key Right
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 4
down Up
sleep 3
shot flying
key Shift_L
up Up
sleep 2
key Return
sleep 4
shot inventory
key Shift_L
sleep 2
key Return
sleep 4
down Up
sleep 3
key F1
up Up
sleep 4
shot f1
key Shift_L
sleep 2
key Return
sleep 4
down Up
sleep 3
key Shift_L
up Up
sleep 2
key Left
sleep 1
key Left
sleep 1
key Left
sleep 1
key Down
sleep 1
key Down
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 4
shot saber
key Shift_L
sleep 2
key Up
sleep 1
key Up
sleep 1
key Right
sleep 1
key Right
sleep 1
key Right
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 4
down Up
sleep 3
key h
sleep 6
shot holomap
key h
sleep 4
sleep 3
up Up
sleep 2
shot after
